DESCRIPTION:Youth Rock NC Durham Pride Event! \nCome kick off Durham Pride weekend with a flash tattoo fundraising event at the Pinhook! On Saturday\, September 26th from 1-6 PM\, come admire the amazing work done by local queer/trans artists\, hang out at Pinhook\, and maybe get a tattoo of your own! \nThis is a sliding scale event with a minimum pricing starting at $75. Masking required.
