SUMMARY:The Midlife Replenish
DESCRIPTION:A nourishing mini-retreat for women navigating the physical\, emotional\, and energetic shifts of midlife. This season of life is rarely linear\, and neither is the experience of living in a changing body while balancing work\, family\, caregiving\, and personal growth. \nTogether\, we’ll create space to slow down\, reconnect\, and replenish through gentle movement\, breathwork\, reflection\, and meaningful connection. The retreat is designed to support nervous system regulation\, ease tension\, build strength\, and foster a sense of grounding and renewal. Along the way\, we’ll honor both the challenges and the wisdom that emerge during this chapter of life\, making room for humor\, community\, and shared experience. \nAll bodies\, backgrounds\, and stages are welcome. Come exactly as you are: tired\, strong\, overwhelmed\, hopeful\, curious\, or somewhere in between. Leave feeling supported\, restored\, and more connected to yourself and others.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/the-midlife-replenish/
LOCATION:Yoga Off East\, 324 Blackwell Street\, Suite 420\, Durham\, 27701
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Screenshot-2026-09-04-at-8.48.06-AM.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Yoga Off East":MAILTO:hello@yogaoffeast.com
