SUMMARY:Durham Oktoberfest
DESCRIPTION:Our annual Durham Oktoberfest is back September 26th in Durham Central Park! \nWe’ll be serving up German style beers like our Festbier\, Hourglass Hefeweizen\, Silent Vice Helles\, Lagerithmic Schwarzbier\, Celestial Kolsch and more in our collectible 12th-Anniversary stein for $15 (including your first fill of any of the beers above). Enjoy $10 refills all day! \n3-7 PM: Craft Market (Applications for vendors here.) \n3-7 PM: German music with DJ Krieger \n3:30 PM: Costume Contest begins (Sign up here.) \n4-6 PM: Beer Puppeteer: Challenge your friends\, no advance sign up needed. \n4:30 PM: Stein Hosting Competition (Men’s and Women’s heats. No advance sign up needed.) \n6:00 PM: Costume contest winners announced. Must be present to win. \n6:30 PM: Keg rolling relay race. Grab a partner and sign up to compete. Space is limited\, and advance signups are required. (Sign up here.) \n7-10 PM: After-party at The Glass Jug Downtown with DJ Gummy \nCheers to a most excellent Durham Oktoberfest! See you at Durham Central Park on September 26th!
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/durham-oktoberfest/
LOCATION:Durham Central Park\, 501 Foster St\, Durham\, NC\, 27701\, United States
CATEGORIES:Craft,Festival,Markets,Music
