SUMMARY:J Weeks Entertainment Presents "Getting Married Again" Stage Play
DESCRIPTION:Getting Married Again is a hilarious and heartfelt new stage play that explores the complicated\nroad of family\, forgiveness\, and second chances. Blending laugh-out-loud comedy with raw\nemotional drama\, the production follows a man determined to rebuild the family he lost while\nconfronting the past he tried to outrun. This powerful story highlights the preservation of family\,\nthe courage to rise again\, and the truth that love\, no matter how messy\, is worth fighting for. \nOpening Night on Saturday\, September 26\, will feature the return of the Black Tie Affair and Art\nShow\, beginning at 5:30 PM. Guests will enjoy a red carpet experience and an exclusive\nexhibition of original paintings\, drawings\, and sculptures created by talented local artists before\nthe curtain rises at 7:00 PM. The evening continues J Weeks Entertainment’s commitment to\ncreating a space where local visual artists and live theater can thrive together.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/j-weeks-entertainment-presents-getting-married-again-stage-play/2026-09-26/
LOCATION:Durham Arts Council\, 120 Morris Street\, DURHAM\, NC\, NC\, 27701\, United States
CATEGORIES:Theater
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://downtowndurham.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/IMG_4021.jpg
