SUMMARY:Durham Ghost Walk
DESCRIPTION:Explore the spooky side of Durham’s history on this tour of the city’s most haunted locations. From the disgraced sons of tobacco giants who continue to roam their old factories\, to tales of tragic accidents whose victims still haunt the site of their end\, and murder victims who stubbornly cling to their possessions\, Durham\, NC\, has a shadowy side to its history. \nTravel through the city with the assistance of a professional historian guide\, while hearing about the city’s creepiest folklore.
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/durham-ghost-walk/2026-09-26/
