SUMMARY:Durham Geek and Grub Market (Cottagecore Edition)
DESCRIPTION:Grab your cloak\, channel your inner hobbit\, and step into the Cottagecore Edition of Geek and Grub Market at the Durham Armory. This FREE woodland-inspired event features 40+ whimsical geeky vendors\, cozy food trucks\, special guests\, and storybook-worthy activities. Think mushrooms\, meadow vibes\, and cottage aesthetics galore. Come wander and find your next little treasure. \nBegin your adventure at our check-in desk at the main entrance of the building\, where little geeks can receive a free goodie from our treasure chest or find out how to participate in our free scavenger hunt. Refresh at our Geek Tavern with a selection of non-alcoholic geektastic beverages. \nEVENT FAQs\nDo I need a ticket for Entry? No ticket required for this Geektastic journey! \nWhere do I Park? There is tons of street parking (free on weekends) and paid parking in nearby garages. \nWill there be food and drinks? There will be food trucks plus there will be non-alcoholic themed mocktails at our indoor Geek Tavern. \nHow Does the Scavenger Hunt Work? Find 8 of our COTTAGECORE Gambits and return to the HQ Desk to win a prize! \nHow Do I Become a Vendor at this Event? Click here to submit an application to vend at this event. \nIs this event handicapped accessible? Absolutely! The event is fully accessible! \nCan We View Vendors Ahead of Time? Yes! Ten days before our event\, simply visit our website to view the vendor list and map before the event. \nAre Pets Welcome at this Event? Only service dogs will be able to attend this event – but feel free to bring them to our next event at Optimist Farm in Apex!
URL:https://downtowndurham.com/event/durham-geek-and-grub-market-cottagecore-edition/
LOCATION:Durham Armory\, 212 Foster Street\, Durham\, NC
CATEGORIES:Festival,Free
